  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Noobosaur.png\" title=\"Helpful Noobsaur.\"><img alt=\"Helpful Noobsaur.\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"317\" src=\"/images/recovered/Noobosaur.png\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Noobosaur.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Helpful Noobsaur.</div></div></div>\n<p>The Helpful Noobosaur is found in Dew Valley and dances around to attract the attention of all newbies!  He offers lots of help and quests.  Another one stands outside the entrance to <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a> and near the Commander in <a href=\"/wiki/Pwnston\" title=\"Pwnston\">Pwnston</a>.  There may be others scattered around the game.  If you find one, add it to this page!\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
